<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:17:28 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>Miz Jeannie店铺图标</title><link>https://some.pics/6afcfca6308ec</link><description>&lt;p&gt;米兹·珍妮商店图标（网站页眉标记）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Miz Jeannie shop icon (site header mark)" height="160" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afcfca6308ec.png" width="160"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:17:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>蓝岭暮色田野</title><link>https://some.pics/6afcfca3a14ef</link><description>&lt;p&gt;站点主题艺术——蓝岭田野，黄昏（方形）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Site theme art — Blue Ridge field, dusk (square)" height="1400" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afcfca3a14ef.jpg" width="1400"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:17:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>蓝岭暮色田野</title><link>https://some.pics/6afcfca0deb0b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;站点主题艺术——蓝岭田野，黄昏（宽幅）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Site theme art — Blue Ridge field, dusk (wide)" height="914" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afcfca0deb0b.jpg" width="2400"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:17:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>蓝岭田野日间主题艺术</title><link>https://some.pics/6afcfc9e279a1</link><description>&lt;p&gt;站点主题艺术——蓝岭田野，日光（方形）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Site theme art — Blue Ridge field, daylight (square)" height="1400" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afcfc9e279a1.jpg" width="1400"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:17:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>蓝岭田野日间主题艺术</title><link>https://some.pics/6afcfc9b813f8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;站点主题艺术——蓝岭田野，日光（宽幅）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Site theme art — Blue Ridge field, daylight (wide)" height="914" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afcfc9b813f8.jpg" width="2400"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:17:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>笔芯墨水耗尽仍书写三天</title><link>https://some.pics/6afcf65b49265</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我猜这支笔总有一天会写不出来，但已经三天了，好多页纸都写过去了，我明明看不到里面有*任何*墨水，它却依然坚挺。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Bic Cristal pen and a handwritten page " height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/petebrown/6afcf65b49265.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://petebrown.some.pics"&gt;@petebrown&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:50:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>私密咒语同样有意义</title><link>https://some.pics/6afcee50397c6</link><description>&lt;p&gt;保持咒语私密并不会让它变得不那么有意义。你可以制作一个护身符，悄悄放进包里，而不拍照或在线解释。这项工作对你有意义，无需他人看见。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted charcoal-black and muted rose fantasy illustration of a mature witch tucking a cloth charm into a shoulder bag inside an ornate hanging lantern home above a distant city, with rose curtains, wooden furniture, a green fern, ivory serif lettering, and a gold emblem at bottom-right. Text: Keeping a spell private doesn't make it less meaningful. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afcee50397c6.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:16:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>梅肯Fresh Produce唱片店淘碟</title><link>https://some.pics/6afcc036f06d0</link><description>&lt;p&gt;在梅肯市中心的本地唱片店Fresh Produce Records里，浏览着琳琅满目的黑胶唱片。这是个闲逛的好地方。除了唱片，他们还出售二手CD、DVD和卡带，以及复古音响设备。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A person browses through a collection of vinyl records in a record store, standing in front of a wall displaying album covers. Various records are arranged in wire racks, including albums by Radiohead and Nirvana. The person, wearing a light-colored T-shirt and a backward black cap, is seen from behind while flipping through records in the bins below." height="4864" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6afcc036f06d0.jpg" width="3648"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:59:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>十年前的今日照片</title><link>https://some.pics/6afc883919dd8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;这是10年前今天的照片。通过On This Day（https://flohgro.com/onthisday/）找到的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Eight meme posters and a red-lettered sign reading 'Türe defekt' (Door defective) are attached to a glass door. The posters feature images and text referencing broken doors, such as 'BRACE YOURSELF MEMES ARE COMING BACK'." height="1237" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/flohgro/6afc883919dd8.jpg" width="700"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://flohgro.some.pics"&gt;@flohgro&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:00:49 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>结束不想要义务的蜡烛咒语</title><link>https://some.pics/6afc81a127788</link><description>&lt;p&gt;结束不想要的责任的蜡烛咒语
https://mizjeannie.com/spells-workings/candle-spell-for-ending-an-unwanted-obligation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Portrait black-and-muted-pink spell reference card with readable cream text, woodland and mountain ornaments, and a candle, petition, herbs, stylus, pen and lighter on a stone table. All approved directions and cautions are present. The gold watermark at bottom right matches the second reference image." height="1536" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afc81a127788.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:32:35 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>